OL,3,AElon Musk's millions failed to deliver
OL,4,ARepublican wins in fierce midterms
OL,5,
OL,6,FOther races where Musk spent millions
OL,7,Fincluded Arizona, Michigan, Wisconsin
OL,8,Fand Minnesota. His spending continued
OL,9,Finto Monday, records show.
OL,11,FBy Tuesday night, Musk seemed to admit
OL,12,Fdefeat, joking on X that his
OL,13,F"election-interfering space lasers
OL,14,Fdidn't work."
